					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500416,
					"content": "I'm Augustus Lovelace, a researcher from Fontaine Research Institute of Kinetic Energy Engineering.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500417,
						733500418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500417,
					"content": "Fontaine Research Institute of Kinetic Energy Engineering?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500419
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 733500419,
					"content": "It's a mouthful, isn't it? You can call it the Fontaine Research Institute, as most people in Fontaine do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500420,
					"content": "The Fontaine Research Institute used to be a paradise for researchers in Fontaine and where most mechanical creations originated.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500421,
					"content": "But thanks to Mr. Edwin, most buildings in the Fontaine Research Institute are lying in ruin now...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500422,
					"content": "And ever since Raimondo and Mr. Choiseul took over the reconstruction project, the spirit of research at the institute has been in freefall.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500423,
					"content": "I have standards and prefer a tidy environment. I refuse to live in a pile of rubble, and so I've been traveling around.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500424,
					"content": "Don't let my troubles spoil your mood, they have nothing to do with you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500425,
					"content": "Come on, please hurry and snap a photo for me. Once Xavier sees the beauty of Sumeru, there's no way he'll stay in Inazuma!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500426,
						733500436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500426,
					"content": "I've worked with Xavier...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500427
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 733500427,
					"content": "You... Whoa! Are you the Traveler that Xavier told me about?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500428,
					"content": "A pleasure! It's truly an honor to meet you! I've read all about your heroic feats in the Mikage Furnace from Xavier's letters.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500429
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500429,
					"content": "And whenever Xavier talks about films in his letters, he always mentions your extraordinary acting skills!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500430,
					"content": "He says you're fearless, noble, and most importantly, you have a great sense of humor!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500431,
					"content": "Oh, once you've taken the photo, you must give me your autograph. It would be perfect if you signed the photo!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500432,
					"content": "How is Xavier doing these days?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500433
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 733500433,
					"content": "Well, to be honest... not great. He's anxious about his film, and based on his letters, he has been having trouble finding an interesting new subject lately.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500434,
					"content": "I suggested that he should do as I did and take some time off in Sumeru.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500435,
					"content": "But he keeps insisting that he must shoot the best possible film for the Yashiro Commission, and he refuses to leave Inazuma until it's done.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500441,
					"content": "That's enough of that. Come and take a photo of me. Right here will do.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500436,
					"content": "How did you get to know Xavier?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500437
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 733500437,
					"content": "As you must be well aware, Xavier is a researcher from the Fontaine Research Institute. We used to work in the same laboratory, and he once gave me quite a bit of help.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500438
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500438,
					"content": "He insisted on shooting a film and being the director. That wasn't a very popular idea in Fontaine Research Institute at the time.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500439
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500439,
					"content": "Even after being assigned to other projects, he still continued shooting \"dokumentari films\" in the name of recording their research process.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500442,
					"content": "Just like that, he went back and forth between projects and the laboratory until he was finally sent to Inazuma...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500440
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500440,
					"content": "He's a very resourceful person. I'm certain that had he been born in the past, when funding was abundant and more fields of research were accepted, or been born in a brighter future, he would have accomplished great things...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Augustus Lovelace"
				},
				{
					"id": 733500418,
					"content": "What kind of place is that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500419
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 733500405,
					"content": "What can I do for you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733500406
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}